\code{lambda = Inf}, soft thresholding of \eqn{X'X\alpha_k} keeping its
\eqn{c_k} largest entries;
\item \eqn{\alpha_k = (I - A_{k-1}A_{k-1}')X'X\beta_k}, normalised, where
\eqn{A_{k-1}} holds the earlier \eqn{\alpha}'s,
